 = 0.17"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":119.62,"default_fair_val":119.62,"premium_pct":47.3,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":18.9,"pe_forward":16.6,"pb_trailing":5,"pb_forward":4.5,"div_yield":2.7,"ps_ratio":4.4,"fcf_to_ev":3.81,"fcf_to_mcap":5.62,"liab_to_assets":139.4,"cash_to_assets":2.8,"current_ratio":0.17,"roe":18,"roa":8.4,"moat":{"ticker":"SBAC","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SBA Communications 作為電信基礎設施提供商，其品牌價值體現在與主要電信營運商建立的長期合作關係和可靠的服務聲譽上。雖然其服務本身並非消費品，但其在行業內的專業度和穩定性構成了無形的品牌資產。定價權主要來自於與客戶簽訂的長期租賃合約，這些合約通常包含固定的租金增長條款，使其能夠抵禦部分通貨膨脹壓力。然而，其定價能力仍受制於市場的整體供需狀況以及客戶的議價能力。","comment_en":"SBA Communications' brand value lies in its long-standing relationships with major telecom operators and its reputation for reliable service. While not a consumer product, its industry expertise and stability form an intangible brand asset. Pricing power stems primarily from long-term lease agreements with clients, which typically include fixed rent escalation clauses, offering some protection against inflation. However, pricing power is still constrained by overall market supply/demand dynamics and customer bargaining power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SBA Communications 的業務高度依賴於對土地和基礎設施的長期租賃權，這些權利往往受到嚴格的土地使用規劃和地方政府的監管。公司在獲取和維護這些關鍵地點的權利方面，實際上扮演著類似於特許經營的角色。雖然沒有傳統意義上的專利，但其在特定地點的獨家或優先租賃權，以及在複雜監管環境中運營的能力，構成了顯著的進入壁壘。這類資產的獲取成本高昂且耗時，對潛在競爭者構成了挑戰。","comment_en":"SBA Communications' business heavily relies on long-term leases for land and infrastructure, which are subject to strict zoning regulations and local government oversight. The company effectively operates with a quasi-franchise model in securing and maintaining rights to these critical locations. While lacking traditional patents, its exclusive or preferential leasing rights in specific locations, coupled with its ability to navigate complex regulatory environments, create significant entry barriers. Acquiring such assets is costly and time-consuming, posing a challenge to potential competitors."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"電信營運商將其基站設備遷移至新的基礎設施提供商面臨極高的轉換成本。這不僅涉及物理設備的搬遷和重新安裝，還包括重新申請頻譜執照、進行網絡測試與整合，以及潛在的服務中斷風險。這些複雜性和成本使得營運商傾向於與現有提供商維持長期合作關係，從而為 SBA Communications 提供了穩定的客戶基礎和較低的客戶流失率。","comment_en":"Telecom operators face extremely high switching costs when relocating their base station equipment to a new infrastructure provider. This involves not only the physical relocation and reinstallation of equipment but also re-application for spectrum licenses, network testing and integration, and the potential risk of service disruption. The complexity and cost incentivize operators to maintain long-term relationships with existing providers, offering SBA Communications a stable customer base and low churn."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"SBA Communications 的業務模式本身不直接產生網絡效應。其價值在於提供物理基礎設施，而非連接用戶或數據的平台。雖然一個地區內有更多的基站可能間接提升網絡覆蓋質量，但這更多是規模擴張的結果，而非用戶互動帶來的價值遞增。因此，網絡效應並非其核心競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"SBA Communications' business model does not inherently generate network effects. Its value lies in providing physical infrastructure, not in connecting users or data platforms. While more towers in an area might indirectly improve network coverage quality, this is more a result of scale expansion than value accretion from user interactions. Therefore, network effects are not a core competitive moat for the company."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為行業領導者之一，SBA Communications 受益於顯著的規模經濟效應。其龐大的基礎設施網絡使其能夠以較低的單位成本獲取土地、建設和維護基站。與小型競爭對手相比，SBA 在與供應商談判、優化運營流程以及分攤固定成本方面具有優勢。這種成本結構上的差異使其能夠提供更具競爭力的租賃價格，同時維持健康的利潤率。","comment_en":"As one of the industry leaders, SBA Communications benefits from significant economies of scale. Its vast infrastructure network allows it to acquire land, construct, and maintain towers at a lower unit cost. Compared to smaller competitors, SBA has an advantage in negotiating with suppliers, optimizing operational processes, and spreading fixed costs. This cost structure difference enables it to offer more competitive lease rates while maintaining healthy profit margins."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"SBA Communications 的核心資產是其在全球範圍內擁有的、遍佈關鍵地理位置的數萬個通信站點。這些站點的獲取難度極高，涉及複雜的土地權談判、地方政府審批以及與眾多地主的協調。許多優質站點的稀缺性，以及其在特定區域的集中佈局，構成了難以複製的地理資產壁壘。這些資產是電信網絡運營的基礎，其獨特性和戰略價值極高。","comment_en":"SBA Communications' core assets are its tens of thousands of communication sites located in key geographic positions globally. Acquiring these sites is extremely difficult, involving complex land rights negotiations, local government approvals, and coordination with numerous landowners. The scarcity of many prime locations, coupled with their concentrated deployment in specific regions, forms an inimitable geographic asset barrier. These assets are fundamental to telecom network operations, possessing high uniqueness and strategic value."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SBA Communications 在運營效率方面表現出色，這得益於其標準化的運營流程、先進的監控技術以及經驗豐富的管理團隊。公司能夠高效地管理其龐大的資產組合，包括租賃管理、維護和擴建。持續的技術投入和流程優化，使其能夠在滿足客戶需求、降低運營成本的同時，保持較高的資產利用率和盈利能力。其 F-Score 7/9 和 ROE 18.0% 也印證了其良好的運營效率。","comment_en":"SBA Communications demonstrates strong operational efficiency, driven by standardized processes, advanced monitoring technology, and an experienced management team. The company efficiently manages its vast portfolio, including lease administration, maintenance, and expansion. Continuous investment in technology and process optimization allows it to meet customer demands and reduce operating costs while maintaining high asset utilization and profitability. Its F-Score of 7/9 and ROE of 18.0% also attest to its sound operational efficiency."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SBA Communications 在資本配置方面展現出較為穩健的策略。公司一方面透過長期租賃合約穩定現金流，另一方面積極尋求擴張機會，包括收購和新建站點，以滿足不斷增長的 5G 和物聯網需求。其較高的 ROE (18.0%) 和 ROA (8.4%) 表明其資本配置能夠產生良好的回報。儘管負債水平較高（$15,209.1M），但其強勁的自由現金流 (FCF TTM: $1,050.7M) 提供了足夠的償債和再投資能力，顯示出管理層在平衡增長與財務穩健方面的能力。","comment_en":"SBA Communications exhibits a relatively robust capital allocation strategy. The company secures stable cash flow through long-term lease agreements while actively pursuing expansion opportunities, including acquisitions and new tower construction, to meet growing demand for 5G and IoT. Its strong ROE (18.0%) and ROA (8.4%) indicate effective capital deployment generating good returns. Despite a high debt level ($15,209.1M), its strong Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $1,050.7M) provides ample capacity for debt servicing and reinvestment, demonstrating management's ability to balance growth with financial prudence."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，電信營運商遷移基站的成本極高，這自然導致了 SBA Communications 擁有極高的客戶留存率。一旦營運商在 SBA 的站點上部署了設備，他們就極少會選擇遷移。這種客戶黏性是其商業模式的基石，為公司提供了高度可預測的收入流。長期合約的續簽和客戶在現有站點上增加設備（例如部署 5G 設備）的趨勢，進一步鞏固了客戶關係和收入穩定性。","comment_en":"As noted in M3, the high cost for telecom operators to relocate their base stations naturally leads to very high customer retention for SBA Communications. Once an operator deploys equipment on an SBA site, they are highly unlikely to move. This customer stickiness is a cornerstone of its business model, providing a highly predictable revenue stream. Contract renewals and the trend of customers adding equipment (e.g., for 5G deployment) to existing sites further solidify customer relationships and revenue stability."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SBA Communications 的業務具有高度的持久性。其核心資產——通信站點，是現代通信網絡不可或缺的一部分，並且隨著 5G、物聯網等技術的發展，其需求預計將持續增長。基礎設施的物理壽命長，且更換成本高昂。此外，公司與主要電信營運商簽訂的長期合約，以及其在關鍵地理位置的佈局，都為其業務提供了長期的穩定性和可見性。這使其能夠抵禦短期經濟波動和技術變革的衝擊。","comment_en":"SBA Communications' business possesses high durability. Its core assets, communication towers, are indispensable to modern communication networks, and demand is expected to grow with advancements like 5G and IoT. The physical infrastructure has a long lifespan and is costly to replace. Furthermore, the company's long-term contracts with major telecom operators and its strategic geographic positioning provide long-term stability and visibility. This allows it to withstand short-term economic fluctuations and technological disruptions."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"SBA Communications 的護城河主要體現為一種「收費橋」模式，其核心在於對稀缺且難以複製的通信站點資產的控制權。這些地理位置優越的站點是電信營運商網絡的關鍵節點，遷移成本極高，形成了強大的客戶黏性與收入穩定性。公司透過規模經濟和卓越的運營效率，進一步鞏固了其成本優勢。雖然缺乏傳統的品牌或專利壁壘，但其對關鍵基礎設施的壟斷性租賃權，使其在行業內具有類似特許經營的地位。儘管面臨一定的債務壓力，但強勁的自由現金流和持續的資本配置能力，支撐了其長期的競爭優勢和持久性。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"SBA Communications operates a 'toll bridge' style moat, centered on its control over scarce and difficult-to-replicate communication tower assets. These strategically located sites are critical nodes for telecom operators, and the high switching costs create strong customer stickiness and revenue stability. Economies of scale and operational efficiency further bolster its cost advantages. While lacking traditional brand or patent moats, its exclusive leasing rights to essential infrastructure grant it a quasi-franchise status within the industry. Despite some debt, strong free cash flow and prudent capital allocation support its long-term competitive advantage and durability.","evidenceHash":"fd05d6a0f688ac79bc13bfce69e7733894d7573867ba1f01766dbe960a3de189","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"64a4a02777258768e0b26987835e58d261181ba0bb5cccb243d7c89482872b73"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"64a4a02777258768e0b26987835e58d261181ba0bb5cccb243d7c89482872b73"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SBAC.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SBAC.png","website":"https://www.sbasite.com","ceo":"Brendan Thomas Cavanagh","full_time_employees":"1844","description":"SBA Communications Corporation stands as a premier owner, operator, and provider of crucial wireless communication infrastructure across North, Central, and South America, in addition to South Africa. Guided by its mission to 'Build Better Wireless,' the company primarily earns revenue from two core business areas: the leasing of antenna space and providing comprehensive site development services. Its central activity revolves around renting out capacity on its shared communication towers to various wireless service providers through long-term contractual agreements. For further details, please visit www.sbasite.com.","description_en":"SBA Communications Corporation stands as a premier owner, operator, and provider of crucial wireless communication infrastructure across North, Central, and South America, in addition to South Africa. Guided by its mission to 'Build Better Wireless,' the company primarily earns revenue from two core business areas: the leasing of antenna space and providing comprehensive site development services. Its central activity revolves around renting out capacity on its shared communication towers to various wireless service providers through long-term contractual agreements. For further details, please visit www.sbasite.com.","description_zh":"**SBA Communications Corporation (SBAC) 業務營運概述**\n\nSBA Communications Corporation (SBAC) 為北美、中南美洲及南非地區領先的無線通訊基礎設施所有者、營運者及供應商。公司以「Build Better Wireless」為使命，主要營收來自兩大核心業務：**天線空間出租**及**基地台站點開發服務**。\n\n其核心營運模式為透過長期合約，將其建置的共享通訊基地台（即行動通訊基地台站點）的容量出租給多元化的無線通訊服務供應商。這類服務供應商包含大型電信營運商及其他需要無線訊號覆蓋的企業。SBAC 透過擁有、營運及管理這些關鍵基礎設施，為客戶提供穩定可靠的無線通訊解決方案，並從中收取租金及相關服務費用。公司專注於擴展其基礎設施網絡，以滿足日益增長的無線數據傳輸需求。","address":"8051 Congress Avenue","city":"Boca Raton","state":"FL","zip":"33487-1307","country":"US","phone":"561-995-7670","full_address":"8051 Congress Avenue, Boca Raton, FL 33487-1307, US","range_52w":"156.6-224.46","year_high":224.46,"year_low":156.6,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":156.6,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-20","name":"Montagner Marc","title":"officer: EVP - CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":1588,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-20","name":"Montagner Marc","title":"officer: EVP - CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":624,"price":187.06,"total_val":0.12},{"date":"2026-10-20","name":"Montagner Marc","title":"officer: EVP - CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":1588,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-19","name":"Krouse George R Jr","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":300,"price":182.67,"total_val":0.05},{"date":"2026-08-04","name":"DAY DONALD","title":"officer: EVP - SITE LEASING","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":457,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-04","name":"DAY DONALD","title":"officer: EVP - SITE LEASING","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":170,"price":180.98,"total_val":0.03},{"date":"2026-08-04","name":"DAY DONALD","title":"officer: EVP - SITE LEASING","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":457,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-27","name":"BERNSTEIN STEVEN E","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1108,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-27","name":"STOOPS JEFFREY","title":"director, other: CHAIRMAN","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1108,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-27","name":"Wilson Amy E","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":110